{attrib, output=false, tags=paper_found }

{x_desk
    {message
        output={@

The desk in your parents' office is made of a similar deep colored wood as
the walls of the room. There is a green felt material on the top surface.
It contains a number of drawers, all of which are locked - and the locks
appear to be substantial, not the usual kind you find in desks, that mostly
just make it inconvenient to try to get into the drawers. These appear to
actually be designed to keep people out.

        }
    }
}

{x_on_desk
    {message
        output={@

The top of the desk is immaculate. There is a brass pen holder that contains
two very expensive looking pens. There is also a small wooden box of empty
envelopes. Nothing else clutters the desk.

        }
    }
}

{x_under_desk
    {message
        output={@

You crouch down to look under the desk. There is nothing under there.

        }
    }
}

{x_behind_desk
    {message
        output={@

Behind the desk is a luxurious looking leather chair.
<?[room]((paper_found)) = 'false'?>
You decide to sit in the chair. And when you do, you notice a small bit of
white sticking out of the bottom 'seam' of one of the drawers. You hadn't
noticed it before sitting down.

It is a piece of paper.
</?>

        }
    }

    {set, logic=[room]((paper_found)), output=true }
}

{x_paper
    {message
        output={@
You carefully extract the paper from the gap beneath one of the drawers.
There is one word written on it:

**Retrograde**

You aren't sure what it means.
What are your parents up to?

You slip the paper back, so it is exactly as you found it.

        }
    }
}




{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_desk))
    {act, logic=x_desk, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_on_desk))
    {act, logic=x_on_desk, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_under_desk))
    {act, logic=x_under_desk, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_behind_desk))
    {act, logic=x_behind_desk, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_paper_piece))
    {act, logic=x_paper, tags=!_type|room }

    {logic
        logic={@
            ?[room]((paper_found)) = 'true'
        }
        output={@

What paper?

        }
    }
}
